G1 Z+0.5 E-5 ;X-20 Y-20 F80 ;move Z up a bit and retract filament even more
G28 X0 ;Y0 ;move X/Y to min endstops, so the head is out of the way
G1 Y180 F2000
M84 ;steppers off
G90
M300 S1318 P266
M82 ;absolute extrusion mode
M104 S0
